1. The kata's four tests, with Username::new as the canonical() helper
   "  Alice  "       -> "alice"
   "Foo   Bar\tBaz"  -> "foo-bar-baz"
   "bob"             -> "bob"
   borrow round trip -> grace-hopper, r.to_owned() == u: true
   all four assertions hold, unchanged

2. Raw text can no longer become a UsernameRef
   parse("  Grace  Hopper ") -> Err, did you mean Username("grace-hopper")?
   parse("grace-hopper")     -> Ok(grace-hopper)

3. The checks the transforming to_owned failed, run again
   tidy.to_owned().borrow() == tidy       true
   to_mut() kept the value                true
   Cow::Borrowed == Cow::Owned            true
   seats.get(parse("ada"))                Some(3)
